            "And here is where you can see how far the drill has gone.  The further down she goes, the better minerals there are.  And keep an eye out on your capacity levels.  You don't want to overload.": "A tady uvid�te, jak daleko se vrt�k u� dostal. &#268;�m n�e se dostane, t�m lep�� nerosty najdeme. A d�vejte pozor na svoji kapacitu. Nechcete, aby se p&#345;eplnila.",
            "Seller": "Prodejce",
