            "DRILL CENTER": "BOREMASKINECENTER",
            "Welcome Mr.Mine, I know you are new to this company so the workers here will show you around": "Velkommen til, Mr.Mine. Jeg ved du er ny i virksomheden, s� derfor vil arbejderne her vise dig rundt",
            "Click to Continue": "Klik for at Forts�tte",
            "Digger": "Graver",
            "Oh wow it's THE Mr.Mine. It's an honor! I'm Digger. I dig up minerals and collect them for you. All your minerals are shown on the top.": "Wow! Det er SELVESTE Mr.Mine - en stor �re! Jeg er Graver. Jeg graver mineraler op og indsamler dem for dig. Alle dine mineraler vises p� toppen.",
            "I see you've noticed the drill that I made. A fine piece of machinery ain't she? She helps us get down to the lower levels in the mine. It might take a while but she'll get through.": "Jeg kan se at du har lagt m�rke til boremaskinen jeg lavede. Hun er et fint stykke maskineri, hva'? Hun hj�lper os med at n� ned til de dybere niveauer i minen. Det tager muligvis lidt tid, men hun skal nok n� igennem.",
            "And here is where you can see how far the drill has gone.  The further down she goes, the better minerals there are.  And keep an eye out on your capacity levels.  You don't want to overload.": "Og her er hvor du kan se, hvor langt boremaskinen er n�et. Jo l�ngere ned hun n�r, desto bedre mineraler er der. Hold �je med dine kapacitetsniveauer. Du skulle n�digt overfylde din kapacitet.",
            "Seller": "S�lger",
            "Do you have max capacity yet? If so, come on in and I can sell your ores at the best prices.": "Har du maksimal kapacitet endnu? Hvis ja, s� kom inden for, s� jeg kan s�lge din malm til de bedste priser.",
            "I can manage our team of diggers.  Hire more diggers and upgrade them with shiny new tools.  They'll need it!": "Jeg kan styre vores graver-hold. Ans�t flere gravere og opgrad�r dem med skinnende, nyt v�rkt�j. De f�r brug for det!",
            "Mechanic": "Mekaniker",
            "Don't listen to Digger, he didn't build the drill.  But she sure is a beaut'. I can help upgrade her if you give me the right resources.  Buy the blueprints and use the right amount of minerals to craft the pieces.  Then equip them from your INVENTORY.": "Lad v�re med at lytte til Graver, han byggede ikke boremaskinen. Hun er da lidt af en smuksak. Jeg kan hj�lpe med at opgradere hende hvis du giver mig de rette ressourcer. K�b planerne og brug den rette m�ngde mineraler for at crafte delene. Tag dem derefter p� fra din BEHOLDNING. ",
            "What did mechanic say about me? Well anyways, we're going to get pretty deep in the mine so use these arrows to move up or down the mine to check up on us. We might find something cool down there.": "Hvad sagde mekanikeren om mig? N�, i al fald, vi kommer til at n� rimeligt langt ned i minen, s� brug disse pile for at bev�ge dig op og ned i minen, for at tjekke op p� os. Vi finder m�ske noget fedt dernede.",
            "Wow it seems like you already mined some minerals! You are a natural.": "Wow, det ser ud til at du allerede har indsamlet nogle mineraler! Du er et naturtalent.",
            "Little Henry": "Lille Henrik",
            "My family was killed by the monsters from below.<br><br>Please Mr.Mine, save our city.": "Min familie blev dr�bt af monstrene fra dybet.<br><br>Mr.Mine, vil du ikke nok redde vores by.",
            "Mayor": "Borgmester",
            "Henry get out of here. Go play with the other orphans or something. <br><br>I'm the mayor of this town. At one point many thousands of years ago our city was on the surface but due to tectonic shifts we were swallowed by Earth. Due to our advanced technology the city survived and even thrived.": "Henry, skynd dig v�k. G� hen og leg med de andre for�ldrel�se b�rn.<br><br>Jeg er borgmester i denne by. P� et tidspunkt, for mange tusinde �r siden, l� vores by p� jordens overflade, men p� grund af tektoniske �ndringer, s� blev vi slugt af jorden. P� grund af vores avancerede teknologi, s� overlevede byen og trivedes endda.",
            "About 10 years ago our oil preserves began to run out. We got our best engineers to work on a solution.  The solution was a futuristic oil rig which uses Californium and the rare Polonium-3.<br><br>The problem began when we started drilling for oil using this machine. Suddenly demons appeared and began to take out people and pull them below.  We can only assume they are dead.": "For cirka 10 �r siden begyndte vores olielager at l�be t�rt. Vi fik vores bedste ingeni�rer til at arbejde p� en l�sning. L�sningen var en futuristiske olieplatform, som bruger Californium og det sj�ldne Polonium-3.<br><br>Problemet opstod da vi begyndte at bore efter olie med denne maskine. Pludseligt var der d�moner, som begyndte at tr�kke folk ned i dybet. Vi kan kun formode, at de er d�de.",
            "Tyrus III": "Tyrus III",
            "The Weapon Man": "V�benmanden",
            "Oh yeahhh they are dead mayor. Those monsters ate them up.<br><br>Those monsters won't be around long. I will eliminate them. I won't sleep or eat or breathe until they are dead.<br><br>Bring me a weapon and I will make it strong. Bring me a monster and I will make it dead. TYRUS!": "Jeps, de er d�de, hr. borgmester. De monstre spiste dem.<br><br>S�danne monstre kommer ikke til at leve l�nge. Jeg vil eliminere dem. Jeg kommer hverken til at sove, spise eller tr�kke vejret, f�r de er d�de.<br><br>Skaf mig et v�ben, s� forbedrer jeg det. Skaf mig et monster, s� dr�ber jeg det. TYRUS!",
            "Those monsters won't be around long. I will eliminate them. I won't sleep or eat or breathe until they are dead.": "S�danne monstre kommer ikke til at leve l�nge. Jeg vil eliminere dem. Jeg kommer hverken til at sove, spise eller tr�kke vejret f�r de er d�de.",
            "Bring me a weapon and I will make it strong. Bring me a monster and I will make it dead. TYRUS!": "Skaf mig et v�ben, og jeg forbedrer det. Skaf mig et monster, og jeg dr�ber det. TYRUS!",
            "Please I beg of you save our people and our culture.<br><br>You may use our technology (oil rig and mineral compressor) and our weapons refinery.": "Please, vil du ikke nok redde vores folk og vores kultur.<br><br>Du m� gerne bruge vores teknologi (olieplatformen og mineralkompressoren) og vores v�benraffinaderi.",
            "You may use our technology (oil rig and mineral compressor) and our weapons refinery.": "Du m� gerne bruge vores teknologi (olieplatformen og mineralkompressoren) og vores v�benraffinaderi.",
            "Idle your way through the mines, and discover what great mysteries lie in the depths below.": "Driv langsomt gennem minerne, og opdag hvilke store mysterier der gemmer sig i dybet nedenunder os.",
