            "This looks to be a rare specimen. I shall have to add it to my collection.": "&#2351;&#2361; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2349; &#2344;&#2350;&#2370;&#2344;&#2366; &#2354;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2309;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2327;&#2381;&#2352;&#2361; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2326;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404;",
