            "Ain't here to be jawing around, either you buying or you ain't.": "&#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2351;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2328;&#2370;&#2350;&#2344;&#2375; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2310;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;, &#2310;&#2346; &#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2379; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2375;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375; &#2351;&#2366; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2326;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;&#2375;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375;&#2404;",
            "Hello old chap. Would you mind trading a few things with this footsore trader?": "&#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379; &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2404; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346; &#2311;&#2360; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2330;&#2368;&#2395;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2393;&#2352;&#2368;&#2342;-&#2398;&#2352;&#2379;&#2393;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375;?",
            "Golly, I haven't seen anyone for days down here. I have some excellent wares for sale.": "&#2325;&#2360;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375;, &#2350;&#2376;&#2306;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2312; &#2342;&#2367;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2351;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2342;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366;&#2404; &#2350;&#2375;&#2352;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2348;&#2375;&#2361;&#2340;&#2352;&#2368;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
            "This mine is looking mighty spiffy, old chap. I'd be willing to trade for something": "&#2351;&#2361; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344; &#2342;&#2367;&#2326;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2341;&#2379;&#2396;&#2368; &#2331;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2354;&#2327; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2404; &#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2330;&#2368;&#2395; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2342;&#2354;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2354;&#2375; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;&#2404;",
            "Gee willikers, I've been looking for that. Would be interested in trading?": "&#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2361;&#2368; &#2340;&#2354;&#2366;&#2358; &#2341;&#2368;&#2404; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2375;&#2330;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2375;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375;?",
            "Excuse me! Hello!! I lost my lipstick and I can't find it. One of your workers stole it and I need it back, like NOW.": "&#2350;&#2366;&#2398; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366;! &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;!! &#2350;&#2375;&#2352;&#2368; &#2354;&#2367;&#2346;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2367;&#2325; &#2326;&#2379; &#2327;&#2351;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2351;&#2375; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368;&#2404; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2360;&#2375; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2369;&#2352;&#2366; &#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2351;&#2375; &#2309;&#2349;&#2368; &#2311;&#2360;&#2368; &#2357;&#2392;&#2381;&#2340; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;",
            "Can you keep it down? We've gotten a few complaints from nearby mines.": "&#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2350; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;? &#2361;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2310;&#2360;&#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2375; &#2326;&#2366;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2358;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2351;&#2340; &#2350;&#2367;&#2354; &#2352;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
            "Hey! We're doing a fund raiser are you interested in any of this garbage?": "&#2361;&#2375;! &#2361;&#2350; &#2346;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2332;&#2369;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2379;&#2358;&#2367;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2311;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2330;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2367;&#2354;&#2330;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
            "You need to add more grass.  This place is a nightmare.": "&#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2324;&#2352; &#2328;&#2366;&#2360; &#2354;&#2327;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2351;&#2361; &#2332;&#2327;&#2361; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2348;&#2375;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
            "Can you hurry up and make up your mind on whether you want this? I have places to go.": "&#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2346; &#2332;&#2354;&#2381;&#2342;&#2368; &#2348;&#2340;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305;&#2327;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2351;&#2361; &#2354;&#2375;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2351;&#2366; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306;? &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; &#2349;&#2368; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2360;&#2366;&#2352;&#2368; &#2332;&#2327;&#2361; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
            "I am very important, please don't waste my time.": "&#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2350;&#2361;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;, &#2325;&#2371;&#2346;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2352;&#2366; &#2357;&#2392;&#2381;&#2340; &#2348;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;",
            "Where is your manager!? This is horrible service.": "&#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2325; &#2325;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2361;&#2376;!? &#2351;&#2361; &#2348;&#2375;&#2361;&#2342; &#2328;&#2335;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2360;&#2375;&#2357;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
