            "Don't listen to anyone else now, honey. I promise to give you the best prices.": "&#2309;&#2348; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2348;&#2366;&#2340; &#2350;&#2340; &#2360;&#2369;&#2344;&#2379;, &#2346;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375;&#2404; &#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2310;&#2346;&#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2342;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;, &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2360;&#2375; &#2309;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2366; &#2342;&#2366;&#2350; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2342;&#2375;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404;",
            "I am the real deal. You better treat me right if you want to do future business.": "&#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2348;&#2361;&#2369;&#2340; &#2350;&#2361;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;&#2404; &#2309;&#2327;&#2352; &#2310;&#2346;&#2325;&#2379; &#2349;&#2357;&#2367;&#2359;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2375;&#2352;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2309;&#2330;&#2381;&#2331;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2375;&#2358; &#2310;&#2311;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;",
            "Wha? Why is it so dark here? I think I fell through a hole but I can't remember.": "&#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;? &#2351;&#2361;&#2366;&#2305; &#2311;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2309;&#2305;&#2343;&#2375;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2379;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;? &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2354;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2350;&#2376;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2327;&#2337;&#2381;&#2338;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2327;&#2367;&#2352; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2370;&#2305;, &#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2367;&#2344; &#2350;&#2369;&#2333;&#2375; &#2351;&#2366;&#2342; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
