            "Mechanic": "Mechanik",
            "Don't listen to Digger, he didn't build the drill.  But she sure is a beaut'. I can help upgrade her if you give me the right resources.  Buy the blueprints and use the right amount of minerals to craft the pieces.  Then equip them from your INVENTORY.": "Nie s&#322;uchaj Pan Kopacza, on nie zbudowa&#322; &#380;adnego wiert&#322;a. Ale nie zmienia to faktu, &#380;e jest cude&#324;kiem. Mog&#281; je ulepszy&#263;, je&#380;eli znajdziesz pan odpowiednie zasoby. Nale&#380;y kupi&#263; plany i wykorzysta&#263; odpowiednie ilo&#347;ci minera&#322;�w, aby stworzy&#263; cz&#281;&#347;ci. Nast&#281;pnie wybra&#263; je w EKWIPUNKU.",
            "What did mechanic say about me? Well anyways, we're going to get pretty deep in the mine so use these arrows to move up or down the mine to check up on us. We might find something cool down there.": "Co niby powiedzia&#322; o mnie mechanik? Niewa&#380;ne, b&#281;dzie wchodzi&#263; do&#347;&#263; g&#322;&#281;boko do kopalni, wi&#281;c trzeba korzysta&#263; z tych strza&#322;ek aby porusza&#263; si&#281; w g�r&#281; i d�&#322; i sprawdza&#263;, jak nam idzie. Mo&#380;e nawet znajdzie Pan co&#347; ciekawego.",
            "Wow it seems like you already mined some minerals! You are a natural.": "&#321;a&#322;, ju&#380; Pan wykopa&#322; troch&#281; minera&#322;�w! Wrodzony talent!",
            "Little Henry": "Ma&#322;y Henryk",
            "My family was killed by the monsters from below.<br><br>Please Mr.Mine, save our city.": "Moj&#261; rodzin&#281; zabi&#322;y podziemne potwory. <br><br> Prosz&#281;, Mr.Mine, niech Pan uratuje nasze miasto.",
            "Mayor": "Burmistrz",
            "Henry get out of here. Go play with the other orphans or something. <br><br>I'm the mayor of this town. At one point many thousands of years ago our city was on the surface but due to tectonic shifts we were swallowed by Earth. Due to our advanced technology the city survived and even thrived.": "Henryk, zmykaj mi st&#261;d. Pobaw si&#281; z innymi sierotami czy co&#347;. <br><br> Jestem burmistrzem tego miasteczka. Tysi&#261;ce lat temu, miasto by&#322;o na powierzchni, ale zmiany tektoniczne pos&#322;a&#322;y nas w g&#322;&#281;bie Ziemi. Dzi&#281;ki zaawansowanej technologii miasto przetrwa&#322;o i dalej si&#281; rozwija&#322;o.",
            "About 10 years ago our oil preserves began to run out. We got our best engineers to work on a solution.  The solution was a futuristic oil rig which uses Californium and the rare Polonium-3.<br><br>The problem began when we started drilling for oil using this machine. Suddenly demons appeared and began to take out people and pull them below.  We can only assume they are dead.": "Oko&#322;o 10 lat temu, nasze rezerwy ropy zacz&#281;&#322;y si&#281; ko&#324;czy&#263;. Najlepsi in&#380;ynierowie szukali rozwi&#261;zania. Opracowali futurystyczn&#261; platform&#281; wiertnicz&#261; wykorzystuj&#261;c&#261; Kaliforn oraz bardoz rzadki Polon-3. <br><br> Problem zacz&#261;&#322; si&#281;, gdy j&#261; uruchomili&#347;my. Nagle, pojawi&#322;y si&#281; demony i zacz&#281;&#322;y &#322;apa&#263; ludzi, wci&#261;gaj&#261;c ich ni&#380;ej. Zak&#322;adamy, &#380;e nie &#380;yj&#261;.",
            "Tyrus III": "Tyrus III",
            "The Weapon Man": "Zbrojmistrz",
            "Oh yeahhh they are dead mayor. Those monsters ate them up.<br><br>Those monsters won't be around long. I will eliminate them. I won't sleep or eat or breathe until they are dead.<br><br>Bring me a weapon and I will make it strong. Bring me a monster and I will make it dead. TYRUS!": "O tak, ju&#380; dawno nie &#380;yj&#261;, panie burmistrz. Stwory ich zjad&#322;y. <br><br> Te potwory d&#322;ugo tu nie po&#380;yj&#261;. Zajm&#281; si&#281; nimi. Nie b&#281;d&#281; jad&#322;, spa&#322;, ni oddycha&#322; p�ki nie padn&#261;. <br><br> Znajd&#378; mi bro&#324;, a sprawi&#281;, &#380;e b&#281;dzie silniejsza. Znajd&#378; mi potwora, a sprawi&#281;, &#380;e b&#281;dzie martwy. TYRUS!",
            "Those monsters won't be around long. I will eliminate them. I won't sleep or eat or breathe until they are dead.": "Te potwory d&#322;ugo tu nie po&#380;yj&#261;. Zajm&#281; si&#281; nimi. Nie b&#281;d&#281; jad&#322;, spa&#322;, ni oddycha&#322; p�ki nie padn&#261;.",
            "Bring me a weapon and I will make it strong. Bring me a monster and I will make it dead. TYRUS!": "Znajd&#378; mi bro&#324;, a sprawi&#281;, &#380;e b&#281;dzie silniejsza. Znajd&#378; mi potwora, a sprawi&#281;, &#380;e b&#281;dzie martwy. TYRUS!",
            "Please I beg of you save our people and our culture.<br><br>You may use our technology (oil rig and mineral compressor) and our weapons refinery.": "B&#322;agamy, uratuj nasz lud i nasz&#261; kultur&#281; <br><br> Mo&#380;esz wykorzysta&#263; nasz&#261; technologi&#281; (platform&#281; wiertnicz&#261; i kompresor minera&#322;�w), oraz nasz&#261; rafineri&#281; broni",
            "You may use our technology (oil rig and mineral compressor) and our weapons refinery.": "Mo&#380;esz wykorzysta&#263; nasz&#261; technologi&#281; (platform&#281; wiertnicz&#261; i kompresor minera&#322;�w), oraz nasz&#261; rafineri&#281; broni",
            "Idle your way through the mines, and discover what great mysteries lie in the depths below.": "Zwied&#378; kopalnie i odkryj tajemnice ukryte w g&#322;&#281;bi.",
