            "I'm nearly done with my research, but I'm missing something. Would you be willing to trade?": "Prawie sko&#324;czy&#322;em swoje badania, ale czego&#347; mi brakuje. Czy by&#322;by&#347; sk&#322;onny do handlu?",
            "Well shoot! Hang me up and put a diaper on me, it's a traveler! Wanna trade?": "O kurcz&#281;! No po prostu postawcie mnie na maszcie i b&#281;d&#281; flag&#261;, podr�&#380;nik! Co ty na handelek?",
            "Ooh boy, we got a live one here! Need any sundries? I'm willing to trade anything.": "Oooo, ten &#380;yje! Potrzebujesz czego&#347;? Jestem got�w na handel czymkolwiek.",
            "Howdy partner! Ol' Sally says I best be getting rid of this stuff now.": "Witajcie! &#379;onka m�wi, &#380;e musz&#281; si&#281; tego pozby&#263;.",
            "Aint here to give ya'll a tear squeezer but I'm 'bout darn near down to the blanket.": "Nie mam zamiaru wyciska&#263; do &#322;ez, ale prawie nic mi nie zosta&#322;o.",
            "'bout Yee'd my last Haw partner, just trying to sell some goods and settle down.": "Ju&#380; prawi&#281; po mnie kolego, sprzedaj&#281; co mam i chc&#281; si&#281; ustatkowa&#263;.",
            "Ain't here to be jawing around, either you buying or you ain't.": "Nie b&#281;d&#281; tu k&#322;apa&#322; jadaczk&#261;, kupujesz albo nie.",
            "Hello old chap. Would you mind trading a few things with this footsore trader?": "Witaj przyjacielu, chcesz pohandlowa&#263; ze zm&#281;czonym kupcem?",
            "Golly, I haven't seen anyone for days down here. I have some excellent wares for sale.": "O rany, od kilku dni nikogo tu nie spotka&#322;em. Mam sporo ciekawych rzeczy na handelek.",
            "This mine is looking mighty spiffy, old chap. I'd be willing to trade for something": "Ta kopalnia wygl&#261;da bardzo fajnie, stary kolego. By&#322;bym got�w co&#347; pohandlowa&#263;.",
            "Gee willikers, I've been looking for that. Would be interested in trading?": "O kuuurcz&#281;, szuka&#322;em takiego. Chcesz pohandlowa&#263;?",
            "Excuse me! Hello!! I lost my lipstick and I can't find it. One of your workers stole it and I need it back, like NOW.": "Przepraszam! Halo! Zgubi&#322;am szmink&#281; i nie mog&#281; jej znale&#378;&#263;. Jeden z twoich pracownik�w j&#261; ukrad&#322;, a ja potrzebuj&#281; jej, TERAZ.",
            "Can you keep it down? We've gotten a few complaints from nearby mines.": "Czy mo&#380;ecie by&#263; ciszej? Pobliskie kopalnie skar&#380;&#261; si&#281; na was.",
            "Hey! We're doing a fund raiser are you interested in any of this garbage?": "Hej, robimy zbi�rk&#281;! Interesuj&#261; ci&#281; te &#347;mieci?",
            "You need to add more grass.  This place is a nightmare.": "Potrzeba wi&#281;cej trawy, to miejsce to jaki&#347; koszmar.",
            "Can you hurry up and make up your mind on whether you want this? I have places to go.": "Mo&#380;esz si&#281; pospieszy&#263; i zdecydowa&#263;, czy to chcesz? Mam gdzie by&#263;.",
            "I am very important, please don't waste my time.": "Jestem bardzo wa&#380;n&#261; osob&#261;, nie marnuj mi czasu.",
            "Where is your manager!? This is horrible service.": "Gdzie jest tw�j kierownik? Paskudna obs&#322;uga.",
            "Hi! All these big miner men have nothing but talk. I got the real stuff here.": "Witaj! Ci wszyscy wielcy g�rnicy tylko gadaj&#261;, a ja tu mam co&#347; specjalnego.",
            "Don't listen to anyone else now, honey. I promise to give you the best prices.": "Nie s&#322;uchaj innych, z&#322;otko. U mnie ceny s&#261; najlepsze, obiecuj&#281;.",
            "I am the real deal. You better treat me right if you want to do future business.": "Ze mn&#261; zrobisz interes. Lepiej traktuj mnie na powa&#380;nie, jak chcesz pracowa&#263; w przysz&#322;o&#347;ci.",
            "Wha? Why is it so dark here? I think I fell through a hole but I can't remember.": "H&#281;? Czemu tu tak ciemno? Chyba wpad&#322;em w dziur&#281;, ale nie pami&#281;tam.",
            "I got some rocks, I got some rocks. You, uh, need them? I'm desperate man!": "Mam ska&#322;y. Mam troch&#281; ska&#322;. Eee, potrzebujesz ich mo&#380;e? Jestem zdesperowany!",
            "Come on man, stop looking so hard. I swear it's legit, just buy it already": "No dalej, przesta&#324; tak si&#281; przygl&#261;da&#263;. Przysi&#281;gam, &#380;e to prawdziwe, po prostu ju&#380; kup.",
            "Yep, yep this be the best mine ever. Can't beat this scenery.": "Tje, najlepsza kopalnia w historii. Nic nie pobije tego widoku.",
            "You got a kleenex? This dust is making me...achoo!": "Masz chusteczk&#281;? Przez ten py&#322;, zaraz� apsik!",
            "Ahh bro this mine is the dopest. Mind if I trade you for a souvenir?": "Ch&#322;opie, &#347;wietna kopalnia. Chcesz wymieni&#263; si&#281; za pami&#261;tk&#281;?",
            "Welcome! I've got a few items you may want.  Perhaps a trade?": "Witaj! Mam kilka przedmiot�w, kt�re mog&#261; ci&#281; zainteresowa&#263;. Co ty na handelek?",
            "I have come from very far and have things of great value.": "Przybywam z daleka i mam skarby na handel.",
            "I see those bags you're carrying are heavy. Maybe we can come to an arrangement?": "Widz&#281;, &#380;e torby ci ci&#261;&#380;&#261;. Mo&#380;e si&#281; dogadamy?",
            "You sure these are legitimate? You will not sneak one past me!": "Na pewno s&#261; prawdziwe? Nie dam si&#281; nabra&#263; na fa&#322;szywk&#281;!",
            "Hey yo, you got any 'special gems' know what I mean?": "Hej hej, masz jakie&#347; �specjalne klejnoty�, wiesz o czym m�wi&#281;?",
            "I need more gold for my grill. It's only half done you know. Chicks dig that golden smile.": "Potrzebuj&#281; wi&#281;cej z&#322;ota. To dopiero po&#322;owa, wiesz? Laski lec&#261; na z&#322;oty u&#347;miech.",
            "Harumph.  Quickly now, I don't have much time.": "Eh. Byle szybko, nie mam czasu.",
            "I hate being down here in these mines. My beard gets dirt in it and I can never get it out.": "Nie cierpi&#281; siedzie&#263; w tych kopalniach. W ca&#322;ej brodzie mam brud, nigdy nie da si&#281; tego pozby&#263;.",
            "There are mysteries below this earth you would never believe. I will not speak of them.": "Pod t&#261; ziemi&#261; kryj&#261; si&#281; tajemnice, w kt�re nie uwierzysz. Nie powiem o nich s&#322;owa.",
            "Hiya! Aren't these gems so pretty? Oh I just love all the colors and shapes!": "Heja! Pi&#281;kne klejnotki, nie? Kocham wszystkie kolory i kszta&#322;ty!",
            "I can't wait to see what you have for me!! I'm sure you have something good right?": "Nie mog&#281; si&#281; doczeka&#263;, co tam dla mnie masz! Na pewno co&#347; dobrego, prawda?",
            "Oh boy! Oh Boy! What do you have for me today darling?": "O rany, o jeju! Co tam dla mnie skrywasz, z&#322;otko?",
            "I only trade in the finest materials. Don't waste my time.": "Handluj&#281; tylko najlepszymi materia&#322;ami. Nie marnuj mojego czasu.",
            "Let me inspect that. I must make sure it is real first.": "Daj mi to obejrze&#263;, musz&#281; si&#281; upewni&#263;, &#380;e jest prawdziwe.",
            "I'm looking for quality. Either you have it or you don't.": "Szukam jako&#347;ci. Albo to masz albo nie.",
