            "Be careful when you test the rocks. I've broken a lot of teeth heehee.": "Uwaga przy testowaniu ska&#322;. Z&#322;ama&#322;em ju&#380; wiele z&#281;b�w, hahaha.",
            "I don't know about you, but I love rooting around in the dirt. So many treasures to be had.": "Nie wiem jak ty, ale ja kocham grzeba&#263; w ziemi. Tyle skarb�w.",
