            "What do ya know? I found a rock here under my foot ... It's a red diamond you say? Guess it's my lucky day!": "No i co ty nie powiesz? Znalaz&#322;em minera&#322; zaraz pod stop&#261;� Niby czerwony diament? Chyba mam szcz&#281;&#347;cie!",
