            "Oh wow it's THE Mr.Mine. It's an honor! I'm Digger. I dig up minerals and collect them for you. All your minerals are shown on the top.": "�h wow det �r Mr.Mine i h�gsta person. Vilken �ra! Jag �r Gr�vare. Jag gr�ver upp mineraler och samlar ihop dem �t dig. Alla dina mineraler syns h�gst upp.",
            "I see you've noticed the drill that I made. A fine piece of machinery ain't she? She helps us get down to the lower levels in the mine. It might take a while but she'll get through.": "Jag ser att du uppt�ckt borren jag gjort. Hon �r en riktigt fin maskin, eller hur? Hon hj�lper oss att ta oss ner till gruvans l�ga niv�er. Det kanske tar lite tid men hon tar sig igenom.",
            "And here is where you can see how far the drill has gone.  The further down she goes, the better minerals there are.  And keep an eye out on your capacity levels.  You don't want to overload.": "Och h�r kan du se hur l�ngt ner borren tagit sig. Ju l�gre ner hon tar sig, desto b�ttre mineraler finns det. Och h�ll ett �ga p� dina kapacitetsniv�er. Du vill inte �verbelasta.",
            "Seller": "S�ljare",
            "Do you have max capacity yet? If so, come on in and I can sell your ores at the best prices.": "Har du n�tt maxkapacitet �nnu? I s� fall, kom in s� kan jag s�lja din malm till de b�sta priserna.",
            "I can manage our team of diggers.  Hire more diggers and upgrade them with shiny new tools.  They'll need it!": "Jag kan leda ditt gr�varteam. Anst�ll fler gr�vare och uppgradera dem med skinande nya verktyg",
            "Mechanic": "Mekaniker",
            "Don't listen to Digger, he didn't build the drill.  But she sure is a beaut'. I can help upgrade her if you give me the right resources.  Buy the blueprints and use the right amount of minerals to craft the pieces.  Then equip them from your INVENTORY.": "Lyssna inte p� Digger. Han gjorde inte borren. Men hon �r verkligen en sk�nhet. Jag kan hj�lpa dig att uppgradera henne om du ger mig de r�tta resurserna. K�p ritningar och anv�nd r�tt m�ngd mineraler f�r att bygga delarna. Utrusta dem sedan fr�n dit F�RR�D",
            "What did mechanic say about me? Well anyways, we're going to get pretty deep in the mine so use these arrows to move up or down the mine to check up on us. We might find something cool down there.": "Vad sa mekanikern om mig? Aja, vi ska i alla fall r�tt djupt ner i gruvan s� anv�nd de h�r pilarna f�r att flytta upp eller ner i gruvan och titta till oss. Vi kanske hittar n�got coolt d�r nere.",
            "Wow it seems like you already mined some minerals! You are a natural.": "Wow, det ser ut som om du redan brutit n�gra mineraler! Du �r en naturbeg�vning",
