            "Mayor": "Borgm�staren",
            "Henry get out of here. Go play with the other orphans or something. <br><br>I'm the mayor of this town. At one point many thousands of years ago our city was on the surface but due to tectonic shifts we were swallowed by Earth. Due to our advanced technology the city survived and even thrived.": "Ge dig iv�g Henry. G� och lek med de andra f�r�ldral�sa barnen eller n�got. <br><br>Jag �r stadens borgm�stare. En g�ng f�r m�nga tusen �r sedan befann v�r stad sig p� ytan men p� grund av tektoniska skiftningar svaldes den av jorden. P� grund av v�r avancerade teknologi b�de �verlevde och frodades staden.",
            "About 10 years ago our oil preserves began to run out. We got our best engineers to work on a solution.  The solution was a futuristic oil rig which uses Californium and the rare Polonium-3.<br><br>The problem began when we started drilling for oil using this machine. Suddenly demons appeared and began to take out people and pull them below.  We can only assume they are dead.": "F�r ungef�r 10 �r sedan b�rjade v�ra oljek�llor att ta slut. Vi l�t v�ra b�sta ingenj�rer jobba p� en l�sning. L�sningen var en futuristisk oljerigg som anv�nder californium och den s�llsynta Polonium-3.<br><br>Problemet uppstod n�r vi b�rjade borra efter olja med maskinen. Pl�tsligt kom det demoner som f�ngade tag i m�nniskor och drog ner dem i underjorden. Vi antar helt enkelt att de �r d�da.",
            "Tyrus III": "Tyrus III",
            "The Weapon Man": "Vapenmannen",
            "Oh yeahhh they are dead mayor. Those monsters ate them up.<br><br>Those monsters won't be around long. I will eliminate them. I won't sleep or eat or breathe until they are dead.<br><br>Bring me a weapon and I will make it strong. Bring me a monster and I will make it dead. TYRUS!": "�h ja, de �r d�da borgm�staren. De d�r monstren �t upp dem.<br><br>Monstren kommer inte att finnas kvar l�nge till. Jag kommer att utrota dem. Jag kommer varken att sova eller �ta eller andas tills att de �r d�da.<br><br>Ge mig ett vapen och jag kommer att g�ra det kraftfullt. Ge mig ett monster och jag kommer att d�da det. TYRUS!",
