            "Hire scientists to find rare relics to help you progress further.": "&#38599;&#29992;&#31185;&#23416;&#23478;&#23563;&#25214;&#31232;&#26377;&#25991;&#29289;&#65292;&#24171;&#21161;&#20320;&#21462;&#24471;&#36914;&#23637;&#12290;",
            "Hire scientists to go on excavations and find rare relics": "&#38599;&#29992;&#31185;&#23416;&#23478;&#36914;&#34892;&#25366;&#25496;&#65292;&#23563;&#25214;&#31232;&#26377;&#30340;&#25991;&#29289;",
