            "Mechanic": "Tamirci",
            "Don't listen to Digger, he didn't build the drill.  But she sure is a beaut'. I can help upgrade her if you give me the right resources.  Buy the blueprints and use the right amount of minerals to craft the pieces.  Then equip them from your INVENTORY.": "Kaz&#305;c&#305;y&#305; bo&#351;verin, matkab&#305; o yapmad&#305; ki.  Yine de harika bir &#351;ey. Bana gerekli kaynaklar&#305; verirseniz onu �ok g�zel geli&#351;tirebilirim.  Gerekli planlar&#305; sat&#305;n ve par�alar&#305; i&#351;lemek i�in do&#287;ru miktarlarda madenleri kullan&#305;n.  Sonra da ENVANTER�de bir araya getirin",
            "What did mechanic say about me? Well anyways, we're going to get pretty deep in the mine so use these arrows to move up or down the mine to check up on us. We might find something cool down there.": "Tamirci benimle ilgili ne dedi? Neyse, olduk�a derine inece&#287;iz o y�zden kontrol etmek i�in yukar&#305; ve a&#351;a&#287;&#305; hareket ettirmek i�in bu oklar&#305; kullan. A&#351;a&#287;&#305;da bir yerlerde �ok g�zel &#351;eyler bulabiliriz.",
            "Wow it seems like you already mined some minerals! You are a natural.": "Vay can&#305;na harika madenler bulduk! Do&#287;a harikas&#305;.",
