            "Mayor": "Belediye Ba&#351;kan&#305;",
            "Henry get out of here. Go play with the other orphans or something. <br><br>I'm the mayor of this town. At one point many thousands of years ago our city was on the surface but due to tectonic shifts we were swallowed by Earth. Due to our advanced technology the city survived and even thrived.": "Henry defol git buradan. Git di&#287;er �ks�zlerle ya da ba&#351;ka bir &#351;eyle oyna.<br><br>Bu kasaban&#305;n ba&#351;kan&#305; benim. Binlerce y&#305;l �nce &#351;ehrimiz yery�z�ndeydi ama tektonik hareketlilikler nedeniyle D�nya taraf&#305;ndan yutulduk, ileri teknolojimiz sayesinde &#351;ehir ayakta kald&#305; ve hatta geli&#351;ti.",
            "About 10 years ago our oil preserves began to run out. We got our best engineers to work on a solution.  The solution was a futuristic oil rig which uses Californium and the rare Polonium-3.<br><br>The problem began when we started drilling for oil using this machine. Suddenly demons appeared and began to take out people and pull them below.  We can only assume they are dead.": "Yakla&#351;&#305;k 10 y&#305;l �nce petrol rezervlerimiz t�kenmeye ba&#351;lad&#305;. En iyi m�hendislerimizin bir ��z�m �zerinde �al&#305;&#351;mas&#305;n&#305; sa&#287;lad&#305;k. ��z�m, Kaliforniyum ve ender olarak bulunan Polonyum-3'� kullanan f�t�ristik bir petrol kulesi idi.<br><br>Sorun, bu makineyi kullanarak petrol i�in sondaj yapmaya ba&#351;lad&#305;&#287;&#305;m&#305;zda ba&#351;lad&#305;. Aniden iblisler belirdi ve insanlar&#305; �&#305;kar&#305;p a&#351;a&#287;&#305; �ekmeye ba&#351;lad&#305;. San&#305;r&#305;m �ld�klerini varsayabiliriz.",
            "Tyrus III": "Tyrus III",
